  "details": "ClipBucket v5 through 5.5.3-#197 contains an sql injection vulnerability that allows authenticated users with ad_manager_access permission to inject SQL via the delete parameter in admin_area/ads_manager.php. Attackers can supply time-based blind payloads concatenated into AdsManager::DeleteAd queries to extract user credentials and emails or modify and delete arbitrary records.",
